{"t_ms": 95062, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s0_001", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Check-in Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nStandard check-in time is 2:00 PM. Guests are required to present a valid government-issued photo ID and the booking confirmation at the reception. A refundable security deposit may be collected during check-in, depending on the room category. Early check-in is subject to room availability and hotel policies. Guests arriving before the standard check-in time may request luggage storage free of charge while waiting for their room.\n", "Early Check-in Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests may request an early check-in from 11:00 AM onwards. If a room is available and has been prepared by housekeeping, early check-in will be provided free of charge. Requests are processed on a first-come, first-served basis. Guests arriving much earlier may use the hotel's lounge area and luggage storage facility until their room is ready.", "Early Check-in Policy\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests requesting an early check-in before the standard check-in time of 2:00 PM may be accommodated based on room availability. An additional charge of \u20b91000 applies for approved early check-ins. Guests arriving significantly earlier are encouraged to use the luggage storage facility until their room is prepared."], "scores": [0.45894867181777954, 0.4790048897266388, 0.4838961064815521], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 6756, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
